<para>Both <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_compiled_prompt_template" kindref="compound">CompiledPromptTemplate</ref></computeroutput> (DSL) and any future template backend must satisfy this interface so that the rest of the system can work with templates polymorphically. </para>
